# Debugging and Logging

## Reference
See `docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md`.

## URL Params
| Param | Effect |
|-------|--------|
| `?log=animation:debug` | Animation system at debug |
| `?log=*:trace` | All systems at trace |
| `?logRelay=1` | Send logs to server console |
| `?movementcontrols=1` | Isolated turn/walk test (no characterAI) |
| `?controls=1` | Show control panel |
| `?turn=lerp` | Turn strategy (lerp / snap / reset) |

## npm Scripts
- `npm run dev:log` — common systems (animation, stateMachine, messaging)
- `npm run dev:log:debug` — all systems at debug
- `npm run dev:trace` — all systems at trace

## Movement Controls Mode
`?movementcontrols=1` — manual turn left/right, walk to waypoint, Pause/Resume/Step Frame.

## Step Frame Debug
When paused: Step Frame advances one frame. Enable `?log=animation:debug,position:debug,stateMachine:debug`.

## Turn Snapping Issues
Check `?turn=lerp` vs `snap`; enable `?log=position:debug` for `logFacingChange`.
